Package: multiflexi-netbox
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, php-vitexsoftware-multiflexi-core, multiflexi-cli (>= 2.2.0)
Description: MultiFlexi NetBox credential prototype
 NetBox REST API credential prototype for MultiFlexi core.
 Provides the CredentialProtoType class that defines NETBOXURL and
 NETBOXTOKEN configuration fields used by applications such as isp-tools.

Package: multiflexi-netbox-ui
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, multiflexi-netbox (= ${binary:Version}), multiflexi-web|multiflexi-web5
Description: MultiFlexi NetBox UI components
 NetBox credential dialog for MultiFlexi web interface.
 Probes /api/status/ with the configured token and shows version info.
